  "d.19up4m2": "PUIN",
  "d.1adjth7": "In pânserkruser: dikke gurdels, dûbele railtuorren, in rêchrail en swiere torpedo's.",
  "d.1bhctvm": "THE MOON (COPERNICUS): ribbele moannelânskip mei kraters ûnder in swarte loft.",
